From: Thorch Android storage adaptation
Subject: [PATCH] dm default key android metadata encryption

Based on Android common d2101e7384ec08fe13cc9faf5eccaa6a84048ac9.
Uses Android mainline fallback-aware submission and Linux 7.1 ioctl API.
Preserves bypass through clones, fallback, merges and F2FS GC.

